<p>The United States and Iran are set to hold high-level talks in Islamabad on Saturday, with Vice President JD Vance leading the U.S. delegation under orders from President Trump. Washington is trying to shore up a fragile cease-fire and see whether it can become a more durable arrangement. Pakistan has tightened security in its capital ahead of the meeting, underscoring both the stakes of the negotiations and concern that the truce could unravel before or during the talks. Several outlets are framing the meeting as the most significant direct, senior-level U.S.-Iran contact in decades, raising hopes that diplomacy could open a path away from a wider Middle East war even as tensions persist. Those tensions include disputes tied to Israel’s continued strikes on Lebanon and worries about oil flows. For Pakistan, hosting the talks offers a diplomatic opening but also a major security test, as authorities deploy exceptional measures to keep the negotiations on track.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/jqQmdjfqA4QcMZc2J3UaTAIoFVlPVmA0Ca0M_UhU25U-JmxfIjvm2RK_pCJqOwFYPchVg_0lrgLNjJpz7iQs832P4Pd1OX4blGkOc3i247DkdxN-6h1uNCb4Jqx2HCRbRiU9wjuHfi8TibBPPK20cUsrW8QBThnVF03_gv5BPWaGP3voCGjHUVilla_-t33SHG7ymaGmrJhOf1k7G3yvzSWF_ycz5AnQi_mcLqYUSQaK2ldk' alt='The Foreign Ministry offices in Islamabad, Pakistan, on Thursday. Pakistan will host talks between the United States and Iran.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Advance teams: The U.S. Secret Service had already arrived in Islamabad to handle security arrangements before Vance’s arrival.</li><li>Low-profile negotiator: Vance had stayed notably out of the spotlight during the Middle East conflict before Trump tapped him to lead this mission.</li><li>Pre-talk friction: The Guardian said disputes over the terms of the negotiations had emerged even before the weekend session began.</li><li>Australian stance: Australia said it would play &quot;no offensive role&quot; as the first round approached.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>United States: By sending Vice President JD Vance instead of a lower-ranking envoy, Washington is giving the mission more political weight. Several reports describe it as one of the biggest tests of his career. (<a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/united-states/high-risk-us-v-p-vance-tasked-by-trump-to-lead-iran-talks'>The Straits Times</a>, <a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/04/high-risk-us-vp-vance-tasked-trump-lead-iran-talks'>Al-Monitor</a>)</li><li>Pakistan: Pakistani officials have insisted the negotiations will still go ahead over the weekend despite citywide disruption and anxiety around the cease-fire, signaling that Islamabad wants to project control as host. (<a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/apr/10/islamabad-pakistan-negotiations-iran-us'>The Guardian</a>, <a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/pakistan-prepares-for-us-iran-talks-with-anxiety/article70844695.ece'>The Hindu</a>)</li><li>Iran: Tehran has signaled that its willingness to uphold the truce depends partly on developments in Lebanon, showing that events on the ground outside Pakistan could shape its negotiating stance. (<a href='https://www.dw.com/en/iran-war-vance-heads-to-pakistan-for-talks-with-tehran/live-76729523'>DW</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/04/09/world/middleeast/iran-us-ceasefire-talks-negotiations.html'>What We Know About the U.S.-Iran Cease-Fire Talks in Pakistan</a> - nytimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/pakistan-prepares-for-us-iran-talks-with-anxiety/article70844695.ece'>Pakistan prepares for U.S.-Iran talks with anxiety</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/united-states/high-risk-us-v-p-vance-tasked-by-trump-to-lead-iran-talks'>‘High risk’: US V-P Vance tasked by Trump to lead Iran talks</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/china/diplomacy/article/3349583/time-running-out-vance-leads-us-delegation-islamabad-iran-talks'>‘No offensive role’ for Australia as clock ticks towards first US-Iran talks since war</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/04/high-risk-us-vp-vance-tasked-trump-lead-iran-talks'>&#x27;High risk&#x27;: US VP Vance tasked by Trump to lead Iran talks</a> - al-monitor.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dw.com/en/iran-war-vance-heads-to-pakistan-for-talks-with-tehran/live-76729523'>Iran war: Vance heads to Pakistan for talks with Tehran</a> - dw.com</li><li><a href='https://www.csmonitor.com/World/Asia-South-Central/2026/0409/In-Pakistan-can-the-US-and-Iran-chart-a-new-path-to-peace'>In Pakistan, can the US and Iran chart a new path to peace?</a> - csmonitor.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/apr/10/islamabad-pakistan-negotiations-iran-us'>Islamabad prepares to host historic negotiations between Iran and the US</a> - theguardian.com</li></ul>